    "Welcome to Month 2, Block 9 of our advanced React systems engineering journey. Today, we step into the most fundamental architectural transformation in modern web engineering: React Server Components, commonly abbreviated as RSC. To understand why Server Components represent a generational leap forward, we must first trace the evolutionary bottlenecks that crippled earlier web application architectures.",
